{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents16OUDSListItemDataV","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSListItemData","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData"},{"type":"text","text":" groups all the text-based information that a list item can display:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a mandatory label (either a "},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or a custom "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and optional description, overline,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extra label, and helper text, and slots."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Minimal: label only (String)","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: \"Label\")","","    \/\/ Label with bold style","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: \"Label\", hasBoldLabel: true)","","    \/\/ Custom view as label with accessibility label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: HStack {","            Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")","            Text(\"Custom Label\")","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Favorite Custom Label\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with text label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        hasBoldLabel: false,","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with custom view label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: VStack(alignment: .leading) {","            Text(\"Title\").font(.headline)","            Text(\"Subtitle\").font(.caption)","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Title, Subtitle\",","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Overline as a user-styled rich text (AttributedString)","    \/\/ Same \"overline\" parameter name as the String variant, disambiguated by the value's type.","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: .from(text: \"Overline\",","                        foregroundColor: theme.colors.contentBrandPrimary.color(for: colorScheme),","                        font: someFont)","    )","","    \/\/ Usage with a static list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: data)","","    \/\/ Usage with a navigation list item","    OUDSNavigationListItem(data: data) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ With slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    let dataWithSlot = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Additional content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )","","    \/\/ With text slot and bottom slot (bottom slot displayed under text slot, before helper text)","    let dataWithBothSlots = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Slot content\") },","        bottomSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Bottom content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )"]},{"anchor":"Custom-view-label","level":2,"text":"Custom view label","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When providing a custom view as label:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasBoldLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" property is not applicable; all styling is controlled by the provided view."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must provide an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter so that Voice Over can vocalize the label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" is used in the combined accessibility label of the list item text container."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must also check the accessibility of your custom views (navigation with switch control and full keyboard access, dynamic types, contrast ratios)"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Small-size-behavior","level":2,"text":"Small size behavior","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the list item is displayed in small size (via the "},{"code":".oudsListItemSize(.small)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"overline","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"extraLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" properties are "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" to ensure a compact layout."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Only the "},{"code":"label","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"description","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" remain visible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"bottomSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is also "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", but the "},{"code":"textSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" remains displayed."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ overline, extraLabel and bottomSlot will not be displayed","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: \"Hidden in small\",","        extraLabel: \"Also hidden in small\"","    ))","    .oudsListItemSize(.small)"]},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","type":"aside"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/Slot"]},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(key:overline:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","d